  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the given reaction, only the carbonyl group has been reduced while the carbon- carbon double bonds are unaltered.</p><p>This is possible with the help of Wolf Kishner Reduction whose reagent set is given in Opiton (C).</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f6045544-a78e-4433-8fe1-cb2d0e6f4657-YUII.png\" style=\"width: 301px; height: 128px;\" /></p><p>To reduce the carbonyl groups into alkane wolf -&nbsp;kischner reduction is used, without affecting the double bond.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
